{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Approach object, take it, move to object, check properties, do task or scan area. list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Condition ID = IsPathClear    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    />\"",
